# ArtCraft apps installed from the official signed ArtCraft Flatpak repository
# (https://getartcraft.com/linux). One Flatpak app id per line.
# These apps are alpha software; OnlyOffice stays installed as the fallback.

# Launcher: browse and install the rest of the ArtCraft suite
ai.storyteller.artcraft-launcher

# Design (Photoshop / Illustrator counterparts)
ai.storyteller.photocraft
ai.storyteller.vectorcraft

# PDF reader and editor (Okular stays installed as the stable fallback)
ai.storyteller.pdfcraft

# Office (Word / Excel / PowerPoint counterparts)
ai.storyteller.wordcraft
ai.storyteller.gridcraft
ai.storyteller.deckcraft
